        "body": "## Summary\r\n- allow workspace owners to delete any message while preserving author self-delete\r\n- keep moderators and other members blocked from deleting messages they did not author\r\n- add channel and thread delete controls that only render for eligible users\r\n- render deleted messages as placeholders and remove the stale blue self-message bubble / empty thread hint UI\r\n- rebuild embedded web assets from current `origin/main`\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n- `pnpm --filter @clickclack/web typecheck`\r\n- `go test -v ./apps/api/internal/store/sqlite`\r\n- `go test -v ./apps/api/internal/store/postgres` (Postgres integration smokes skipped without `CLICKCLACK_POSTGRES_TEST_DSN`)\r\n- `go test -v ./apps/api/internal/httpapi`\r\n- `pnpm build`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1258\" height=\"256\" alt=\"{F28D1FAD-D91A-4ADA-99E4-1B95F40C82BA}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d98c045-fc1f-4ec9-a8f0-b35f1f699260\" />\r\n",
